# launch-inventory.allow — lane A. Owners review every change.
# Six tab-separated fields: path, rule, class, owner, expires, reason.
# debt + M6 hides a finding only while the script is report-only.
# not-agent + permanent hides a finding in report-only and in --enforce.
# A new finding needs a reviewed row in the same change. Milestone M6 passes --enforce.
